{"id":29,"title":"解答:  计算引力","summary":"计算  \"引力 \"挑战的答案及解释。","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"4eedec6af8b811eb91773af9d3c2d1d5","text":"## 答案","text_html":"<h2>答案</h2>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"4eedee36f8b811eb91773af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"G = 6.67 * (10 ** -11)\nM = 6.0 * (10 ** 24)   # 地球质量\nm = 7.34 * (10 ** 22)  # 月球质量\nr = 3.84 * (10 ** 8)\n\ngrav_force = (G * M * m) / (r ** 2)\nprint(grav_force)\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"4eedee9af8b811eb91773af9d3c2d1d5","text":"## 解释\n\n上面代码其实很简单。`*`运算符用于不同变量的相乘，`**`是我们需要的幂运算符，用于获取`r`平方。也可以写成`r * r`。\n\n在`grav_force`公式中的括号`()`只是为了使代码更易读，将分子与分母分开。","text_html":"<h2>解释</h2>\n<p>上面代码其实很简单。<code>*</code>运算符用于不同变量的相乘，<code>**</code>是我们需要的幂运算符，用于获取<code>r</code>平方。也可以写成<code>r * r</code>。</p>\n<p>在<code>grav_force</code>公式中的括号<code>()</code>只是为了使代码更易读，将分子与分母分开。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":2}],"status":"undo","course_no":"002","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/002/page/29"}
